# Public build settings for the Clash Of Mercy site and APK.
#
# These values are embedded in the browser bundle and inside the APK, so they are
# public by design (the publishable key is safe to share; row-level security in
# Supabase protects the data). They are committed so every CI/build environment
# — including Vercel projects that have no dashboard variables — builds the same
# working app. scripts/check-supabase-env.mjs still rejects placeholders,
# malformed values and any secret key.
